        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "An exciting challenge for all budding aviators, Air Ranger Rescue Helicopter puts you in the role of Kane, a dedicated rescue pilot. Four enormous stages and eight types of rescue are on offer as you - and your brave colleagues, Bob, Matilda and Ivan - try to avert disaster and save the day. From evacuating runaway trains to extinguishing an inferno from the air, you will be stretched to your limit in this exciting helicopter sim.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un desafío emocionante para todos los aspirantes a aviadores, Air Ranger Rescue Helicopter te pone en el papel de Kane, un piloto de rescate dedicado. Cuatro escenarios enormes y ocho tipos de rescate te esperan mientras tú, junto con tus valientes compañeros Bob, Matilda e Ivan, intentas evitar desastres y salvar el día. Desde evacuar trenes desbocados hasta extinguir un incendio desde el aire, serás llevado al límite en este emocionante simulador de helicópteros.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
